94268084549_4093659349924682527_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=83rl5YpAJ7MQ7kNvwHZPr8v&_nc_oc=AdrSXzWd3H7JbIVptC8jc_IgEMiBIj7Lw2xV0O_-b_rRds_UoaDBCiCsiez35xr9kUg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQREqGSRtqV8eo4h5i9Wl2vNZ2jm7dF0OWlo-AyPqNamxQ&oe=6B0DC853"}, "display_name": "Place To Pray", "keywords": ["church", "pray", "praying", "Bible", "muslims"], "long_description": "Escape the noise of the world and enter a space of total tranquility. Our realistic graphics capture the light, scale, and atmosphere of a grand cathedral, and a big mosque making it the perfect setting for your spiritual journey.\n\nDiscover a new way to connect with your faith. Place to pray invites you into a masterfully crafted, high-fidelity church for Christians and high-fidelity mosque for Muslims, \nenvironment designed to provide a peaceful sanctuary for prayer and study. this experience combines stunning architectural realism with the power of immersive technology.\n\nThe Full Holy Bible and Holy Quran in one app: Engage with the Word of God in a natural, readable format directly within the VR environment.\n\nUse the app as a personal \"play for praying,\" allowing for focused devotion without outside distractions.", "short_description": "Step into a breathtakingly realistic cathedral designed for prayer, peace, and reflection. Experience the Holy Bible in a fully immersive environment, complete with celestial visual effects and a serene atmosphere. Whether for daily devotion or quiet meditation."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/place-for-pray-vr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "8 Owl Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/place-for-pray-vr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873",